  "worked_solution": "We know that Carla has $504$ ounces of almonds in total. Since each package must contain $8$ ounces of almonds, then she will be able to make $504÷8$ packages.\n\nWe start by writing down the question using long division notation:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"150\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\,\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{5\\,\\phantom{|}0\\,\\phantom{|}4}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"250\" align=\"left\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"20\">\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\nNotice that $5$ (the number of hundreds in $504$) is less than the divisor $8.$ Therefore, we should consider both the hundreds and tens:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"150\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\,\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{5\\,\\phantom{|}0\\,\\phantom{|}4}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$↓$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"250\" align=\"left\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Divide: $50÷8=6\\,\\text{R}\\,2$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Write over tens: $6$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"25\">\n<td>Multiply: $8\\times 6=48$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Subtract: $50-48=2$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"25\">\n<td>Bring down: $4$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\nNext, we consider the ones:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"150\" align=\"center\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$6$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"20\" height=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\,\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{5\\,\\phantom{|}0\\,\\phantom{|}4}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$8$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td width=\"15\" height=\"20\" align=\"center\">$\\boxed{\\text{0}}$</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n<td width=\"250\" align=\"left\">\n\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Divide: $24÷8=3$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Write over ones: $3$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"25\">\n<td>Multiply: $8\\times 3=24$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\"> \n<td>Subtract: $24-24=0$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n\nWe get the remainder $0$, so the division is done.\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n504÷8=63.\n$$",
